266
00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.645
No, they're exceptions. Come on.

267
00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.245
Nonsense.
We haven't finished our drinks.

268
00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.481
After you nicked his car...

269
00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:08.966
Dean says you're fair game.

270
00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.720
He don't give a shit what your mum says.

271
00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.131
Listen, boys...

272
00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.488
I've had a rather emotional day...

273
00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:19.964
