286
00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:25.763
Are we going to stand around here all day,
or are we going to fight?

287
00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:13.569
You fucking dirty, fucking dirty...

288
00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:56.211
Sorry about that.

289
00:22:56.360 --> 00:22:58.124
Needed to let off a little steam.

290
00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:02.807
I heard yesterday a friend of mine died.

291
00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:05.008
He knew your father too, actually.

292
00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:09.648
Now, I do apologize, Eggsy.

293
00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:11.802
I shouldn't have done this
in front of you.

294
00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:13.962
No, please!
I won't say nothing, I swear!

295
00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.650
If there's one thing I can do,
it's keep my mouth shut.

296
00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:17.165
- You won't tell a soul?
- Ask the feds.

297
00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:18.321
I've never grassed anyone up.

298
00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:20.801
- Is that a promise?
- On my life!

299
00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.843
Much appreciated, Eggsy.

300
00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.764
You're right about the snobs.

301
00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.161
But there, too, there are exceptions.

302
00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.889
Best of luck with everything.

303
00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:52.444
<i>In celebrity news, the Richmond Valentine
movie premiered in Hollywood last night.</i>

304
00:23:52.600 --> 00:23:55.410
<i>The story of the internet billionaire's
rise to power...</i>

305
00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:58.370
